{"id": 16, "ts": 1784385046.6350784, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "agent_2", "message": "I remain inclined to keep Candidate\u202fB as the provisional choice. While Candidate\u202fD shows strong problem\u2011solving, concentration, and a willingness to take responsibility, the notes also flag a hot temper and a \u201cknow\u2011it\u2011all\u201d attitude, which raise serious crew\u2011cooperation and professionalism concerns for long\u2011haul flights. Moreover, we still lack any concrete evidence of D\u2019s operational reliability, and the only stress\u2011resilience indicator is that D \u201cresponds to unexpected events adequately,\u201d which is weaker than B\u2019s documented \u201chandles stress very well.\u201d Compared with B\u2019s clear reliability (very conscientious) and proven stress handling, D\u2019s profile remains riskier despite his technical strengths. Therefore, I continue to recommend Candidate\u202fB, while we should keep an eye on whether any further information emerges about A or D that could shift the balance."}
